WEBVTT

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:09.380
With a marriage proposal in hand,
Liu Bei set sail for Wu where Sun Quan was waiting.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:16.750
Worried about his lord, Zhuge Kongming gave
three bags to Zhao Yun, who was on escort duty.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:21.960
He said to start by opening the first bag and follow the
stratagem therein when the ship entered Wu.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.210
