such bags from their tactician.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:31.380
The group has finally started in on
the 100,000 Likes Project.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.830
With the outcome hanging in the balance,
Eiko Tsukimi set out for the recording studio.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.290
I'm unable to accompany you
to your recording session,

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.380
but please take these.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:47.290
