jumbo value-size Puri Puddings."

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.540
And thus, Eiko arrived at the studio
carrying her dreams, aspirations,

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:58.420
and jumbo value-size Puri Puddings.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.130
However, those dreams were abruptly shattered.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.500
Listen...

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.500
You're missing your own voice.

