00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.380
Oh, I know!

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:45.670
The king's finally back in town,
so let's pick it up again...

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:47.040
Our cypher!

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:50.830
Still not at the peak...

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.040
Eiko...
Still not at the peak...<b></b>

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.880
Hey, Earth to Eiko!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:59.670
Nanamin?

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.830
Eiko! What a relief!

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.580
Aw, I'm sorry.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.460
I guess I spent too long in the bath.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.670
Good grief!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:09.580
Still, that bath felt really nice.

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:11.420
Oh, you!

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:17.210
Ah, this is a blast!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:19.920
Aww, I should've filmed it.

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:22.540
I could have aimed for 10,000 views!

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:30.790
So, anyway, I hear you're rapping again?

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:32.210
How'd you know that?

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.500
I've got my sources, you know.

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:40.170
But at my current level, I can't beat Sekitoba.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.630
Was it always about winning for you?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.790
Didn't it used to be about having fun?!

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.670
Yo, yo!

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:58.790
Don't put on an act

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.790
Even if you're not cool, you are still you

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:04.170
The way you are, you can be the voice for us all

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.500
Even if you're far way, I'll cheer ya on

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:09.040
You'll always be my pride, you know

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:12.580
Be confident and live your life, Kabetaijin!

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:16.080
Thanks, Sasatcho.

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.540
You didn't make a single rhyme, though.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.920
Hey, man, pointing that out kills the vibe.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.880
But seriously, thank you.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.210
Nanami, you free after this?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:34.540
<b>Shibuya Yu</b>

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:34.540
I'd like to buy you dinner
as a thanks for taking care of me.

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:37.580
Oh? I wonder what I'll ask you to treat me to?

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.630
It can't be anything too pricey, though.

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.040
Cheers!

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:47.210
Ah, that's good!

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:49.710
Eiko, under you nose.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:50.710
Huh?

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:53.790
Here you are!

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:55.130
Your order of mixed monja.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:56.330
Thanks!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.290
Leave this part to me!

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:00.080
Okay, griddle boss!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.630
"As an oni is stronger with an iron rod,
beer calls for monja!"

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:05.830
Here goes!

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.380
Wow, it looks delicious already.

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:13.250
It's a been a while, but I'm still a pro at this.

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:15.460
You used to come here often?

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:17.420
Yeah, like with the owner.

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:18.500
The owner?

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:21.210
Of BB Lounge where I work.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:22.880
He let's me sing there.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:24.580
I see...

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:28.420
It's ready!

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:29.880
Go on, try some.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.670
Thanks for the food!

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:36.290
It's wonderful.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.500
I'll dig in, too.

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:42.830
This's the best!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.920
It's been forever since I had fun
dining out with someone.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.170
Really? What about with your friends?

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.630
Friends, hmm...

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:56.580
Well, no matter how close you are,
sometimes your surroundings change.

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:59.670
Aw, it can be lonely, can't it?

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:02.710
I hope we can keep on laughing together, Nanamin!

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:04.630
You said it!

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:09.960
That reminds me, what made you wanna
perform on the street anyway?

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:12.540
There's someone I wanna get back at, you see.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.210
A person you wanna get even with?

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:15.210
Yeah!

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:18.420
Which is why I'm gonna build up my skills
and get really good!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.290
But...

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:27.130
I'm still nowhere close.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:31.830
Say, Nanamin, why're you so great at singing?

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:36.250
Because I've gained lots of experience.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:37.920
Experience?

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.130
Yeah...

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:41.960
Actually, I-

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.000
I get it!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:46.000
I've just gotta sing a whole bunch to get better, right?

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.130
Y-yeah, that's it.

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:50.630
Um, I'd be happy to teach you if you like.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.460
Really?! Thanks!

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:58.380
Eiko, you know...

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:03.630
It's burning.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.210
The monja!

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.210
It's rock hard!
The bottom's all black!

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:10.420
So hot!

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.750
I'll take a steamed pizza bun and cola today.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:20.250
Get a move on before I get hungrier than I already am.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.880
You still don't get it?

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:25.290
It's pointless for a weakling like you to resist.

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:28.330
Again? You guys cut-

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:30.130
Guys, cut it out!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:32.710
Divine retribution will get ya!

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.040
You reap what you sow!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.580
Someone'll call the po-po!

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:38.130
Look, a cop will show!

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.750
Don't just stand there, let's go!

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:55.670
You're Kabe, aren't you?!

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:56.670
Huh?

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:57.750
My brother's a big fan.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:59.170
He's always watching your videos.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:02.000
O-oh, is that right?

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:03.960
Thank you for helping me out before!

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.670
Oh, it was nothing.

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:11.710
Kabe, you might look really weak,
but you're super cool when you're rapping.

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:13.920
It gives me courage.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.250
It makes me want to try my best, too.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:18.380
Uh, thanks.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:20.750
Please keep on giving it your all!

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:27.330
Sure enough, I am being dissed, right?

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.580
I'm still alive today
<b>14 Days until X Day</b><b></b>

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:40.580
You are so far away

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:44.830
Even though you have broken my heart, baby

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:44.710
<i>I also need to broaden the ways I express myself.</i>

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:46.080
Even though you have broken my heart, baby
