00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.080
I just thought I could not live without you
<b>11 Days until X Day</b><b></b>

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:53.080
Got it!

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:58.130
I just thought I could not live without you
<b>8 Days until X Day</b><b></b>

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:55.170
Try it with more intonation.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.040
That will make your voice more expressive.

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:58.330
Got it!

00:20:58.130 --> 00:20:58.330
<b>8 Days until X Day</b>

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:00.540
Now I don't know what to do with myself
<b>7 Days until X Day</b><b></b>

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.630
Now I don't know what to do with myself

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:13.460
Maybe I'm stronger than I think and I'm still in love

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.920
Eiko, the way you performed just now was amazing.

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:28.630
You truly made the arrangement your own!

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:30.830
Aw, really?

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:32.210
All right!

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:34.920
I can use this to motivate that pudding geezer!

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.170
Pudding geezer?

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.290
Yeah, the guy I wanna get back at.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:40.670
Oh, the one you mentioned before.

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:43.210
Well, I'm gonna head over there.

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:45.580
Okay! Take care.

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:47.630
See you later!

